      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and i felt this really sharp ripping sensation in my mid back that kind of goes down into my stomach area. it hurts a lot but i'm pretty sure i just pulled a muscle or something. should i just take some high dose ibuprofen and sleep it off or is that a bad idea?",
